<title>GREECE: Greece raises 634.7bln drachmas from T-bill issue.</title>
<headline>Greece raises 634.7bln drachmas from T-bill issue.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greece raised a total of 634.7 billion drachmas from the sale of three-, six-and 12-month T-bills last Thursday, a money source told Reuters.</p>
<p>Proceeds from the October 31 issue exceeded maturing paper of 402.2 billion drachmas (interest plus capital).</p>
<p>			     Physical paper	     Book-entry</p>
<p>Three-month T-bills    4.1 bln drachs	   28.8 bln drs</p>
<p>Six-month T-bills	7.2 bln drachs	   29.6 bln drs</p>
<p>12-month T-bills     152.7 bln drachs	  412.3 bln drs</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
